        "name": "Crossbow Ace",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "action"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": 1
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are wielding a crossbow with reload 1 or higher.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Your deep understanding of the crossbow allows you to reload efficiently while moving yourself out of the line of return fire. Either @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Create a Diversion] or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Take Cover], then Interact to reload. As normal, you must meet the requirements to Take Cover; you must be @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Prone], benefiting from cover, or near a feature that allows you to Take Cover.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 1
          },
