          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You've trained with one of the ranger sects known as wardens, who practice a specialized type of primal magic. You gain your choice of one warden spell from these initial warden spells (or another you have access to).</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Gravity Weapon]</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Heal Companion]</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Magic Hide]</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Special</strong> You can take this feat multiple times, choosing a different initial warden spell each time.</p>"
          },
